yzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-23T17:17:10-07:00","id":1409979,"title":"","content":"Not anime, but a CG Meetup Short. <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4xe72U7mXNg\" data-code=\"4xe72U7mXNg\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/4xe72U7mXNg/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/535-bastet","name":"Bastet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar535_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-24T18:44:37-07:00","id":1410178,"title":"","content":"....I'm totally gonna call Avatar a Sparkling Cartoon from now on.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I will second Scrapped Princess as Exalted fodder. Its magic feels very much like Sorcery and the main characters are running from a group of religious knights who want to murder them because of prophesy. So.<br /> <br /> Flame of Recca is &quot;What if we did Exalted, but everyone only had a five dot artifact with cool evocations, instead of innate charms?&quot; Well, and then one guy whined real hard and got to play a Fire Aspect. Ensui, the Water Sword, is a great example, as it's as much a Martial Arts Style as it is an Artifact.<br /> <br /> Marchen Awakens Romance (MAR) is by the same author and, basically, the above concept, but an Isekai story (but from before the craze really took off). If you like evocations and magic items, both series are good to look into.<br /> <br /> As for more recent stuff, Kaguya-sama: Love Is War, is probably a great(?) example of how to make using the Social Influence system feel just as cool as punching a dude. Kaguya-sama works pretty well as an overly sheltered DB (probably a Sesus given that her family raised her to be incapable of trusting people) and Shirogane as a Lost Egg who, via tons of hard work and sacrifice, managed to get to go to one of the Realm's main schools, so I could see it working for a Spiral Academy Game or similar.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tXTx4kpgMlo\" data-code=\"tXTx4kpgMlo\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/tXTx4kpgMlo/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-26T02:11:07-07:00","id":1410482,"title":"","content":"I don't think we have a video game thread, so I'll post it here. I don't know the game but I found the trailer was interesting from an Exalted point of view, with many things happening on screen relating to one or more Exalted typical power tropes.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O2nNljv0MOw\" data-code=\"O2nNljv0MOw\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/O2nNljv0MOw/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-26T08:27:58-07:00","id":1410521,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FMA245</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1387260-your-anime-inspirations-list?p=1409306#post1409306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is very Exalted<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=heJgMo9btX8\" data-code=\"heJgMo9btX8\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/heJgMo9btX8/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Merged with this thread - C.T. Phipps</span></div> </div> </div> </div>For anyone that doesn't mind spoilers for later parts of the story the webtoon here's an example of Wyld Hunt fighting a Beast optimized Solar and his Exigent partner. The scene goes from chapter 412-419.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.webtoons.com/en/action/the-god-of-high-school/ep-412/viewer?title_no=66&amp;episode_no=415\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.webtoons.com/en/action/the-god-of-high-school/ep-412/viewer?title_no=66&amp;episode_no=415\" target=\"_blank\"> Connect Error :: LINE WEBTOON </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.webtoons.com/en/action/the-god-of-high-school/ep-412/viewer?title_no=66&amp;episode_no=415\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.webtoons.com/en/action/the-god-of-high-school/ep-412/viewer?title_no=66&amp;episode_no=415 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26384-doublefriedchicken","name":"DoubleFriedChicken","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-26T15:04:58-07:00","id":1410572,"title":"","content":"Another non-anime animated production.<br /> White Snake (2019) Chinese movie from Light Chaser Animation Studios that's a prequel to The Legend of the White Snake, it's one of the most Exalted things I've ever seen. Like it could've been in the Suggested Resources for Fangs at the Gate. <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FCY7E0oHW6Y\" data-code=\"FCY7E0oHW6Y\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/FCY7E0oHW6Y/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-27T02:08:23-07:00","id":1410623,"title":"","content":"Hmm... I don't have many current ones!<br /> <br /> This is not to say that I don't like modern anime, it's more a question of a shift in what anime are *about*. Anime that I find suitable for Exalted are very &quot;High and Low&quot;; they're characterised by being about people who are emotionally mature adults, or children who've had to grow up fast, who live in a society that is characterized by unjust social problems and they've faced and face challenging circumstances and choices, they're often marginal or outside society in some way (orphans, vagabonds, political rebels), but still ultimately respond with character... despite that they may not make the right choices always.<br /> <br /> They ideally should be from a fantasy or jideigeki (historical Japanese) setting: Ninja Scroll, Berserk, Sword of the Stranger, Dagger of Kamui, Escaflowne, Scrapped Princess, Samurai Champloo, Princess Mononoke. But it's not obligatory - Akira, Wings of Honneamise, Nausicaa, Grave of the Fireflies, Trigun, Wonderful Days, Vampire Hunter D and so on all work well despite being well outside fantasy in a strict sense (at most, sci-fi with elements of fantasy). There can be elements of comedy, but there's also usually some element of serious moral questions about society and justice and how we can prevent war. (Despite why its never been foundational to me, this is also why I think so many people love Avatar: The Last Airbender and its sequel Korra as an &quot;Amerime&quot; inspirational to Exalted, because it absolutely has those themes.)<br /> <br /> Anime these days and for a while, subjectively to me (as perhaps a grumpy middle-aged person), seem to shift more to being about teenage angst and growth in personality (that whole Evangelion lineage of things) that its mostly teenage audience empathize with immediately, and to people who often live in relatively privileged circumstances, and who really confront secret conspiracies, and there's often a very big dose of comedy and slice-of-life elements (and fanservice!). This is not really a &quot;bad&quot; thing! But it does mean that, even for works where you may have many more elements that are surficially, on the surface, like Exalted, in the sense of being replete with supernatural martial arts, Shinto and traditional Chinese gods who intervene frequently in the world, and so on, well, those things don't really hit my personal spot for Exalted inspiration.<br /> <br /> This is not to say I don't love a lot of recent anime; for a short list, pretty much anything recent by Makoto Shinkai, by One (OPM, Mob Psycho), by Studio Trigger (Promare), are absolutely still some of the best anime you'll ever see! Great creative work is still happening. And there are lots of anime from across its history that I love that are totally outside that Exalted-y sweet spot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-31T02:17:42-07:00","id":1411182,"title":"","content":"Technically not an anime, but I advise looking a bit at the game Indivisible which has some good inspirations. <br /> <br /> The transformation cutscenes are interesting, and I also think that the enemy of the game is a good inspiration for a Primordial and the ending fights against her is a good inspiration of what fighting one or a 3rd Circle Demon could look like. <br /> <br /> Here is the videos just for the transformations, I think the 3rd one has a solar-y touch to it : <br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WlrFdA5ypRc\" data-code=\"WlrFdA5ypRc\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/WlrFdA5ypRc/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-01T07:49:31-07:00","id":1411351,"title":"","content":"Friend just introduced me to Wu Shan Wu Xing (Fog Hill of the Five Elements) and goddamn is it a beautiful piece of inspiration. It also apparently only has a six person animation team.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/qZZLkmMeGRY\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/qZZLkmMeGRY\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/qZZLkmMeGRY\" target=\"_blank\"> https://youtu.be/qZZLkmMeGRY </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-01T08:20:20-07:00","id":1411355,"title":"","content":"I watched a garbage anime called Apocalypse Zero, but the antagonist had a good infernal exalted vibe to her, and the &quot;tactical evils&quot; would make good demons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-30T23:47:00-07:00","id":1416213,"title":"","content":"&quot;Akame Ga Kill!&quot; is probably the single best inspiration for 3E Artifacts I've ever seen. Everything about how the legends of these ancient weapons are portrayed, to how the users have to gradually come to a greater understanding of them to bring out their true power, is a great demonstration of Evocations! And, as powerful as their magic armor can be, this show has never even heard of Plot Armor...ANYone can die, just like in early GoT, only main characters throughout the entire show! And it just recently showed up on Netflix...<br /> <br /> Also on Netflix, I'm finding it *impossible* to watch Saint Seiya: The Lost Canvas&quot;, with it's golden armored warriors fighting black armored assassins powered by Death Itself, all while superimposed with glowing zodiac creatures, without being reminded of Exalted every single episode!<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CfZIr2XzuPA\" data-code=\"CfZIr2XzuPA\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/CfZIr2XzuPA/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":681,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","user":"Hand-of-Omega","date":". 10-01-2020, 02:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-09T14:38:29-07:00","id":1417483,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://twitter.com/NXOnNetflix/status/1313151961710043141\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/NXOnNetflix/stat...51961710043141</a> - looks *interesting*. Classical + anime? Death curse of dying titans? Ridiculous demi-god super-action?<br /> <br /> (Is this my personal Exalted inspiration? No. But it seems like the sort of thing that could, or should, end up being someone's... Heck, it may even be Exalted *inspired*.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}